IDEAS

zoxide - https://github.com/ajeetdsouza/zoxide
Copyright 2020 Ajeet D'Souza. MIT License.
The idea behind Breakfast's food ranking is zoxide's "frecency": a score from how often and how recently something was used. No zoxide code is included; the formula is Breakfast's own.


DATA

USDA Food and Nutrient Database for Dietary Studies (FNDDS) 2021-2023
U.S. Department of Agriculture, Agricultural Research Service. FoodData Central, 2019. fdc.nal.usda.gov.
CC0 1.0. Bundled with the app.

Open Food Facts - https://world.openfoodfacts.org/
(c) Open Food Facts contributors.
Database: Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
Product images: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike.
Not bundled. You fetch product data when you scan or search, keep the products you save on your phone, and can send your corrections back.


